      "content": "Attached is the raw scan data. Look closely at the mid-range frequencies. It looks like a synthetic binder, specifically one that resembles a post-1850 organic compound, which is a massive problem if it's actually part of the original layer. If we can't clear this, it's going to be a disaster for the Q4 numbers. What's your professional take on these specific readings?",
